      "requirement": "Exercise the changed gamma lookup behavior by decoding a valid PNG with a gAMA chunk and SPNG_DECODE_USE_GAMA enabled.",
      "target_route": "Supply a valid 1×1 RGBA PNG with a four-byte gAMA chunk before IDAT, then call spng_decode_image with SPNG_DECODE_USE_TRNS | SPNG_DECODE_USE_GAMA.",
